{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_699acd4ba97d5823bd8f1cabd51fefe13fb8f06327cffd3255dc264d1b2d93bc","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_f6d4f4e3ac80cea5161eda791ffd71e8d5903423e38664ea7a2dd3efb4a7fff0"],"source_ids":["src_0545ea67657053e89b075342eb81c6a1"],"text":"Auto Runs execute mini-swe-agent in a Docker environment by default because the agent runs autonomously; local shell execution is an explicit advanced opt-in that gives the agent unrestricted host command access.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_74652a3b62831b900d747c1d380e7ea37a89a2a8214fd7a361482d0593421807","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d95104f0cff6eaa9779a44235d7d60414656388f49fe3efd0ad75d768c52be2"],"source_ids":["src_c30d1eaf229a53b0909062233d684a85"],"text":"A local Auto Worker claims queued runs, manages mini-swe-agent processes, handles cancellation, and writes events and artifacts, keeping long-running jobs separate from request handling.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e6464333ecf12589fc953d9d751453083ee9243650e60a1f3ab0b41c14c0a89","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a7a725328fa6b10989303bdd054e6668cf1d31711ec4c0218a89f717e6f6351","slc_ef165f5ab5983eab1c5670d49faf6a1c1e729e0f04510573602e1441eb39d8f7"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654","src_c0b0146fd12c539e8c23340f4af53345"],"text":"Auto Mode is backed by a bundled mini-swe-agent checkout in vendor/mini-swe-agent with a non-interactive runner at scripts/mini-auto-run.py; an ADR states the bundled copy should be managed as a Git submodule or clearly tracked vendored dependency.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_93207794c906f7a5a3a5e6e38ba6ddc9a9805a92efd99242a9b5a319a3bdb448","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a7a725328fa6b10989303bdd054e6668cf1d31711ec4c0218a89f717e6f6351","slc_277da580540d210fcd37f7facb9b33b8d68ef2201fdb25b8a0e5d337a3120629"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"Before Auto starts, an Environment Doctor checks Git clean state, Docker availability, mini runtime readiness, model API key configuration, and GitHub readiness.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_c8dbd520fe1832b697c76f960007c48bfad79cb9920a451cc59687cd6e6dde45","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_15ee5c43a103a3ee4da43c412b824f779275d6e95387a8a58288203757ec8a6d","slc_1b559a4e20fc08921e54b907b17419240ab5425492eeca9fe21c76ea50f72c83"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"Repository development practice: contributors run npm run test, npx tsc --noEmit, and npm run lint; the repo includes tests for Auto data flow, readiness checks, recommended environments, the mini resolver, and runner behavior with fake mini results.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_caebe72601b17f80ddb6c1159a90fea84a793edaa0f60c8de3addc9fd4d7c9a4","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_6e3f41f2bd25f5343bee9a32ca8c4813d6b659532266ca05686d22c117d4030c","slc_f28e6a23235826739568c5487cd02fb195d7b529b294028fbef35ac87a436312"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"Thrush offers two modes in one UI: Assist, where the agent drafts edits and the user approves before files are written, and Auto, where the agent attempts a full task in isolation and returns a report and diff.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_cb8a432e7cfe1bdf21b8a023f1eff93e4828ede144acb95f3bef8d40e8ef5d2b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_4c59ae45ca7fad22453b62dcfadaef33c3ef870454f241b4feef81b5f9a2a846","slc_5a304ef4f0873beb720b5e73bb0214c4b96285b6a4516f38ac46a16bbe0f232c","slc_a0f3be3217620a47293b0e9519720d7258d31fcf71a7d38ee875b591c1909dd7"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"Auto Mode runs mini-swe-agent in a separate Git worktree under data/auto-runs/<autoRunId>/worktree on a branch auto/<autoRunId>, leaving the main workspace unchanged; Draft PR creation is a user action, not automatic.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_da554f128ee17778a6872f38ab62432877141a3474cb58e3567b7d1f19ffd8b1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_1a7a725328fa6b10989303bdd054e6668cf1d31711ec4c0218a89f717e6f6351","slc_d3962538468def20acecce37a530d7dce0e43921ac14489d9b9f5d318f93a52c"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"Local state lives under data/: a SQLite database (thrush.db) with separate tables for Auto runs, events, artifacts, and presets, plus workspace, auto-runs, mini-venv, and pip/uv cache directories.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_e8315007274e6a17064b2d3d7e1cb1b81721f103b1bff49beab64cb58bfdca43","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=tools-permissions","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_049fb6fdbf9c30b2d693f571b69bdad40a8c518f0c669101abba0ee051033d6d","slc_a73413a7fc92855870ece6bc3ff8b17ed8607e5a892954c33097bc94ef8cd779"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"In Assist Mode the agent can inspect files, search code, read pages, and run allowlisted commands; file writes are staged as pending drafts requiring explicit approval, and file tools reject paths outside the active workspace.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","created_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f2bc33ea7684df7f6a7858e9d8226ef2e94d3c3d788a7b3926bba918a7b18b80","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"shoyann/thrush-swe-agent@daef0a6d6a6d snapshot ad148bedd351dcd1","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_3e4178b6b92b0d1d40dd369c445921ac0c29a249c54d042100f827ab1d3ce984","slc_4cb9ff8c86b100cf59206dd51419d1ad35fa93ae7525192f07c4fcc305dd8bf9"],"source_ids":["src_2f501cf3fdf6502f8d9676eea2fd6654"],"text":"Model providers are configurable via environment variables: MODEL_PROVIDER supports deepseek (default), openai, or anthropic, with per-provider API key, base URL, and model variables, plus an AGENT_API_SECRET bearer token for /api/agent.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:40:06Z","updated_by_operation":"op_e7d77ed90f5043e09226d5ce6b79b42e"}
